# Hub-curated Transmodel/NeTEx-style SKOS rendering for the EV-charging domain.
#
# NeTEx (CEN/TS 16614, the Network Timetable Exchange standard built on the
# Transmodel conceptual model EN 12896) is published natively as XML Schema (XSD)
# and is scoped to public-transport network/timetable/fare data. It does, however,
# carry a real (adjacent) model for vehicle charging and alternative-fuel supply:
# VEHICLE CHARGING EQUIPMENT, REFUELLING EQUIPMENT, BATTERY EQUIPMENT, RECHARGING
# STATION / RECHARGING BAY / RECHARGING POINT ASSIGNMENT and the RECHARGING
# EQUIPMENT (vehicle) PROFILE, with PlugType / CurrentType / PowerCouplingType /
# FuelType enumerations. There is no canonical RDF/SKOS serialisation of NeTEx to
# mirror, so the EONA-X vocabulary hub renders a faithful but compact subset of
# those entities/attributes/enumerations as a SKOS ConceptScheme so it is both
# browsable in Prez and alignable by the crosswalk (#446) against the DATEX II
# EnergyInfrastructure terms. Element/attribute/enumeration NAMES below are taken
# verbatim from the NeTEx v2.0 XSDs; the SKOS framing (Entity/Attribute/Code value)
# is the hub's rendering, not a NeTEx-native artefact.
#
# NeTEx v2.0 source XSDs consulted (github.com/TransmodelEcosystem/NeTEx, branch v2.0):
#   xsd/netex_framework/netex_reusableComponents/netex_nm_equipmentEnergy_version.xsd
#   xsd/netex_framework/netex_reusableComponents/netex_nm_equipmentEnergy_support.xsd
#   xsd/netex_framework/netex_reusableComponents/netex_nm_chargingEquipmentProfile_version.xsd
#   xsd/netex_part_1/part1_ifopt/netex_rechargingPointAssignment_version.xsd
#   xsd/netex_framework/netex_utility/netex_units.xsd (WattageType/VoltageType/WattHoursType = xsd:decimal)
# Standard docs: https://netex-cen.eu/  http://www.transmodel-cen.eu/
#
# Loaded (local=True) into its own named graph:
#   https://eona-x.eu/ontology/netex/v0.2.0#
#
# PRESERVED IRIs referenced by the crosswalk (#446) — do NOT rename:
#   netex:ElectricVehicleChargingEquipment  <->  datex:ElectricVehicleChargingPoint
#   netex:availabilityStatus                <->  datex:status
#   netex:powerRating                       <->  datex:power
#   netex:connectorStandard                 <->  datex:connectorType
#   netex:location                          <->  datex:location

# --- 2026-08-18 full-scope expansion (additive only) ---------------------
# The subset above (6 Entities / 25 Attributes / 49 Code values) was extended
# to cover the FULL native scope of the same 5 NeTEx v2.0 XSD modules already
# cited above (re-fetched and re-read in full from
# github.com/TransmodelEcosystem/NeTEx, branch v2.0):
#   netex_nm_equipmentEnergy_version.xsd, netex_nm_equipmentEnergy_support.xsd,
#   netex_nm_chargingEquipmentProfile_version.xsd,
#   netex_rechargingPointAssignment_version.xsd, netex_units.xsd.
# Every xsd:complexType in those 5 files worth modelling as a domain class,
# every element/attribute the in-scope complex types declare, and every
# enumeration/code-list value they define is now represented. This pass is
# STRICTLY ADDITIVE: every triple already present above (and every original
# line of this file) is unchanged; new material was appended as new blocks
# (new Entities before the ATTRIBUTES header, new Attributes before the CODE
# VALUES header, and a CROSS-LINKS section at the end of the file for the new
# skos:narrower/skos:hasTopConcept edges from pre-existing subjects — written
# as standalone triples rather than edits to the original comma-lists, so no
# original line was touched). No new Code values were needed: the 4 XSD
# enumerations (FuelTypeEnumeration 18, PlugTypeEnumeration 16,
# CurrentTypeEnumeration 4, PowerCouplingTypeEnumeration 6 = 49 minus the 5
# hub-curated availabilityStatus codes = 44 native + 5 hub-curated = 49) were
# already complete in the prior pass; re-verified value-for-value against the
# re-fetched XSDs.
#
# New Entities added (3): TypeOfPlug, TypeOfBatteryChemistry, RechargingBay —
# real xsd:complexType/element pairs in the 5 files that the original curated
# subset had left out.
# New Attributes added (8): typeOfPlug, profileTypeOfPlug (both ObjectProperty,
# range TypeOfPlug), vehicleChargingEquipment (ObjectProperty, range
# ElectricVehicleChargingEquipment), compatibleWith, siteComponent,
# equipmentPlace (DatatypeProperty reference/reference-list, targets out of
# this subset's scope), plugNameOfClassifiedEntityClass,
# batteryChemistryNameOfClassifiedEntityClass (DatatypeProperty, xsd:string).
#
# Deliberately NOT modelled as Entities (documented judgement call, see
# TERMS.md "2026-08-18 full-scope expansion" section for the full reasoning):
# the 9 NeTEx "*_RefStructure" / "*_RelStructure" complexTypes in these 5
# files (VehicleChargingEquipmentRefStructure, RefuellingEquipmentRefStructure,
# BatteryEquipmentRefStructure, TypeOfBatteryChemistryRefStructure,
# TypeOfPlugRefStructure, compatibleEquipmentRefs_RelStructure,
# rechargingPointAssignments_RelStructure, rechargingStations_RelStructure,
# rechargingBays_RelStructure) are NeTEx's standard by-reference XML linking /
# list-container scaffolding, not domain entities. units.xsd contributed no
# new concepts: its one real enumeration (SystemOfUnits) is never referenced
# by any element in the other 4 files, and its remaining simpleTypes are plain
# xsd:decimal/xsd:nonNegativeInteger restrictions already fully captured via
# rdfs:range + skos:editorialNote on the attributes that use them (WattageType,
# VoltageType, WattHoursType). The pre-existing netex:typeOfBatteryChemistry
# attribute was left completely untouched (not given an rdfs:range pointing at
# the new TypeOfBatteryChemistry Entity) to honour "never touch existing
# triples" to the letter, even though it now could be more precisely typed —
# flagged as a follow-up opportunity, not acted on here.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

@prefix netex: <https://eona-x.eu/ontology/netex/v0.2.0#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

# --- Ontology header: version + provenance -------------------------------
<https://eona-x.eu/ontology/netex/v0.2.0#> a owl:Ontology ;
    dcterms:title "NeTEx/Transmodel — EV charging & alternative-fuel subset (EONA-X hub-curated)" ;
    dcterms:description "Hub-curated SKOS rendering of the NeTEx (CEN/TS 16614, Transmodel-based) vehicle-charging and alternative-fuel subset: VEHICLE CHARGING EQUIPMENT, REFUELLING EQUIPMENT, BATTERY EQUIPMENT, RECHARGING STATION and RECHARGING POINT ASSIGNMENT plus the RECHARGING EQUIPMENT PROFILE, with their attributes and PlugType/CurrentType/PowerCouplingType/FuelType enumerations. NeTEx proper is natively XSD and PT-scoped; this is an adjacent, browsable subset for the EMDS demo." ;
    dcterms:source "NeTEx v2.0 XSDs (github.com/TransmodelEcosystem/NeTEx, branch v2.0): netex_nm_equipmentEnergy_version.xsd, netex_nm_chargingEquipmentProfile_version.xsd, netex_rechargingPointAssignment_version.xsd, netex_units.xsd. NeTEx site https://netex-cen.eu/ ; Transmodel http://www.transmodel-cen.eu/ . NeTEx is natively XSD and PT-scoped; this is a curated SKOS rendering of an adjacent EV-charging/alternative-fuel subset." ;
    dcterms:creator "EONA-X Vocabulary Hub" ;
    dcterms:created "2026-06-22"^^xsd:date ;
    dcterms:modified "2026-06-26"^^xsd:date ;
    owl:versionInfo "0.2.0" ;
    rdfs:label "NeTEx/Transmodel — EV charging & alternative-fuel subset" .

# --- ConceptScheme --------------------------------------------------------
netex:ev-charging a skos:ConceptScheme ;
    dcterms:title "NeTEx/Transmodel — EV charging & alternative-fuel (subset)" ;
    rdfs:label "NeTEx/Transmodel — EV charging & alternative-fuel (subset)" ;
    dcterms:description "Vehicle-charging and alternative-fuel terms rendered in a Transmodel/NeTEx style (entities, attributes and code values) as an adjacent subset for the EMDS demo." ;
    dcterms:source "Hub-curated SKOS rendering of the NeTEx v2.0 (CEN/TS 16614, Transmodel-based) charging/alternative-fuel subset; NeTEx is natively XSD and PT-scoped." ;
    skos:hasTopConcept netex:ElectricVehicleChargingEquipment ,
        netex:RefuellingEquipment ,
        netex:BatteryEquipment ,
        netex:RechargingStation ,
        netex:RechargingPointAssignment ,
        netex:RechargingEquipmentProfile .

# === ENTITIES (skos:topConcept) ==========================================
netex:ElectricVehicleChargingEquipment a skos:Concept ,
    owl:Class ;
    skos:inScheme netex:ev-charging ;
    skos:topConceptOf netex:ev-charging ;
    dcterms:type "Entity" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Electric Vehicle Charging Equipment"@en ;
    skos:definition "Equipment at which an electric vehicle can be connected to charge its battery. Renders the NeTEx VEHICLE CHARGING EQUIPMENT (a specialisation of PLACE EQUIPMENT) in a Transmodel/NeTEx style."@en ;
    dcterms:source "NeTEx v2.0 element VehicleChargingEquipment (specialisation of PlaceEquipment), xsd/netex_framework/netex_reusableComponents/netex_nm_equipmentEnergy_version.xsd." ;
    skos:narrower netex:availabilityStatus ,
        netex:powerRating ,
        netex:connectorStandard ,
        netex:location ,
        netex:freeRecharging ,
        netex:reservationRequired ,
        netex:reservationUrl ,
        netex:gridVoltage ,
        netex:currentType ,
        netex:powerCouplingType .

netex:RefuellingEquipment a skos:Concept ,
    owl:Class ;
    skos:inScheme netex:ev-charging ;
    skos:topConceptOf netex:ev-charging ;
    dcterms:type "Entity" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Refuelling Equipment"@en ;
    skos:definition "Equipment for refuelling a vehicle with an alternative or conventional fuel (a specialisation of PLACE EQUIPMENT). Covers non-electric and electric energy supply via its fuel-type classification."@en ;
    dcterms:source "NeTEx v2.0 element RefuellingEquipment (specialisation of PlaceEquipment, +v1.2.2), xsd/netex_framework/netex_reusableComponents/netex_nm_equipmentEnergy_version.xsd." ;
    skos:narrower netex:fuelType .

netex:BatteryEquipment a skos:Concept ,
    owl:Class ;
    skos:inScheme netex:ev-charging ;
    skos:topConceptOf netex:ev-charging ;
    dcterms:type "Entity" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Battery Equipment"@en ;
    skos:definition "Installed battery equipment characterising the energy store that is charged (a specialisation of INSTALLED EQUIPMENT). Describes capacity, voltage and maximum charging power."@en ;
    dcterms:source "NeTEx v2.0 element BatteryEquipment (specialisation of InstalledEquipment, +v1.2.2), xsd/netex_framework/netex_reusableComponents/netex_nm_equipmentEnergy_version.xsd." ;
    skos:narrower netex:batteryCapacity ,
        netex:batteryUsableCapacity ,
        netex:nominalVoltage ,
        netex:maximumChargingPower ,
        netex:typeOfBatteryChemistry .

netex:RechargingStation a skos:Concept ,
    owl:Class ;
    skos:inScheme netex:ev-charging ;
    skos:topConceptOf netex:ev-charging ;
    dcterms:type "Entity" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Recharging Station"@en ;
    skos:definition "A PARKING whose bays (RECHARGING BAYs) are specifically equipped for recharging vehicles. Aggregates the total power available to all of its recharging bays."@en ;
    dcterms:source "NeTEx v2.0 element RechargingStation (specialisation of Parking, +v2.0), xsd/netex_part_1/part1_ifopt/netex_rechargingPointAssignment_version.xsd; contains RechargingBay (a PARKING BAY equipped for recharging)." ;
    skos:narrower netex:totalPower .

netex:RechargingPointAssignment a skos:Concept ,
    owl:Class ;
    skos:inScheme netex:ev-charging ;
    skos:topConceptOf netex:ev-charging ;
    dcterms:type "Entity" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Recharging Point Assignment"@en ;
    skos:definition "The allocation of a public-transport timing point to a site component (such as a PARKING BAY) that holds VEHICLE CHARGING EQUIPMENT; the link that integrates charging infrastructure into the NeTEx public-transport network."@en ;
    dcterms:source "NeTEx v2.0 element RechargingPointAssignment (+v2.0), xsd/netex_part_1/part1_ifopt/netex_rechargingPointAssignment_version.xsd." ;
    skos:narrower netex:servedScheduledStopPoints .

netex:RechargingEquipmentProfile a skos:Concept ,
    owl:Class ;
    skos:inScheme netex:ev-charging ;
    skos:topConceptOf netex:ev-charging ;
    dcterms:type "Entity" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Recharging Equipment Profile"@en ;
    skos:definition "A VEHICLE EQUIPMENT PROFILE describing the charging features a vehicle requires or supports (plug, current, coupling, charging voltage, maximum charging power and timing). Used to match vehicles to compatible charging equipment."@en ;
    dcterms:source "NeTEx v2.0 element RechargingEquipmentProfile (specialisation of VehicleEquipmentProfile), xsd/netex_framework/netex_reusableComponents/netex_nm_chargingEquipmentProfile_version.xsd." ;
    skos:narrower netex:chargingVoltage ,
        netex:profileMaximumChargingPower ,
        netex:preparationDuration ,
        netex:finalisationDuration ,
        netex:profilePlugType ,
        netex:profileCurrentType ,
        netex:profilePowerCouplingType .

# === ADDITIONAL ENTITIES (2026-08-18 full-scope expansion) ===============
# xsd:complexTypes from the same 5 scoped XSDs that the original curated
# subset had not modelled as Entities. Added to netex:ev-charging's top
# concepts via a standalone cross-link triple at the end of this file (rather
# than editing the scheme's original skos:hasTopConcept list above).
netex:TypeOfPlug a skos:Concept ,
    owl:Class ;
    skos:inScheme netex:ev-charging ;
    skos:topConceptOf netex:ev-charging ;
    dcterms:type "Entity" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Type Of Plug"@en ;
    skos:definition "A classification of a PLUG. Gives the plug supported by a VEHICLE CHARGING EQUIPMENT or required by a RECHARGING EQUIPMENT PROFILE an extensible, referenceable TYPE OF ENTITY classification, in addition to the closed PlugTypeEnumeration code list."@en ;
    dcterms:source "NeTEx v2.0 element TypeOfPlug (substitutionGroup TypeOfEntity, complexType TypeOfPlug_ValueStructure, +v1.2.2), xsd/netex_framework/netex_reusableComponents/netex_nm_equipmentEnergy_version.xsd." ;
    skos:narrower netex:plugNameOfClassifiedEntityClass .

netex:TypeOfBatteryChemistry a skos:Concept ,
    owl:Class ;
    skos:inScheme netex:ev-charging ;
    skos:topConceptOf netex:ev-charging ;
    dcterms:type "Entity" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Type Of Battery Chemistry"@en ;
    skos:definition "A classification of a BATTERY CHEMISTRY (e.g. lithium-ion, lead-acid). Gives the chemistry referenced by a BATTERY EQUIPMENT's typeOfBatteryChemistry an extensible, referenceable TYPE OF ENTITY classification."@en ;
    dcterms:source "NeTEx v2.0 element TypeOfBatteryChemistry (substitutionGroup TypeOfEntity, complexType TypeOfBatteryChemistry_ValueStructure, +v1.2.2), xsd/netex_framework/netex_reusableComponents/netex_nm_equipmentEnergy_version.xsd." ;
    skos:narrower netex:batteryChemistryNameOfClassifiedEntityClass .

netex:RechargingBay a skos:Concept ,
    owl:Class ;
    skos:inScheme netex:ev-charging ;
    skos:topConceptOf netex:ev-charging ;
    dcterms:type "Entity" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Recharging Bay"@en ;
    skos:definition "A PARKING BAY specifically equipped for recharging VEHICLEs; the individual bay within a RECHARGING STATION."@en ;
    dcterms:source "NeTEx v2.0 element RechargingBay (substitutionGroup ParkingBay_Dummy, complexType RechargingBay_VersionStructure, +v2.0), xsd/netex_part_1/part1_ifopt/netex_rechargingPointAssignment_version.xsd." .
# RechargingBayGroup (its own local element group) is an empty xsd:sequence in
# this XSD: RechargingBay declares no elements of its own within these 5
# files — everything else is inherited from the out-of-scope ParkingBay_
# VersionStructure base type. Included anyway for completeness (a genuine
# complexType in-file) even though it carries no Attribute children here.

# === ATTRIBUTES (skos:broader <entity>) ==================================
netex:availabilityStatus a skos:Concept ,
    owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    skos:inScheme netex:ev-charging ;
    skos:broader netex:ElectricVehicleChargingEquipment ;
    dcterms:type "Attribute" ;
    rdfs:domain netex:ElectricVehicleChargingEquipment ;
    skos:prefLabel "Availability status"@en ;
    skos:definition "Operational availability status of the charging equipment (e.g. available, occupied, out of service)."@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Value type: enumeration (hub-curated availability status; NeTEx native real-time availability is a SIRI concern)"@en ;
    rdfs:range netex:availabilityStatus ;
    skos:editorialNote "NeTEx enumeration: AvailabilityStatusEnumeration (hub-curated; NeTEx static schema carries no equipment-level availability — real-time status is conveyed via SIRI)."@en ;
    skos:narrower netex:availabilityStatus-available ,
        netex:availabilityStatus-occupied ,
        netex:availabilityStatus-reserved ,
        netex:availabilityStatus-outOfService ,
        netex:availabilityStatus-unknown .

netex:powerRating a skos:Concept ,
    owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    skos:inScheme netex:ev-charging ;
    skos:broader netex:ElectricVehicleChargingEquipment ;
    dcterms:type "Attribute" ;
    rdfs:domain netex:ElectricVehicleChargingEquipment ;
    skos:prefLabel "Power rating (kW)"@en ;
    skos:definition "The rated electrical power of the charging equipment. Renders the NeTEx MaximumPower of VEHICLE CHARGING EQUIPMENT."@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Value type: xsd:decimal (kW; NeTEx native WattageType MaximumPower is expressed in watts [W])"@en ;
    skos:editorialNote "NeTEx element MaximumPower, type WattageType (xsd:decimal, SI watts). Exposed here in kW for alignment with datex:power."@en ;
    rdfs:range xsd:decimal .

netex:connectorStandard a skos:Concept ,
    owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    skos:inScheme netex:ev-charging ;
    skos:broader netex:ElectricVehicleChargingEquipment ;
    dcterms:type "Attribute" ;
    rdfs:domain netex:ElectricVehicleChargingEquipment ;
    skos:prefLabel "Connector standard (plug type)"@en ;
    skos:definition "The physical connector / plug standard offered by the charging equipment (e.g. Type 2, CCS, CHAdeMO). Renders the NeTEx PlugType."@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Value type: enumeration (NeTEx PlugTypeEnumeration). Each value may also be classified by a NeTEx TypeOfPlug."@en ;
    rdfs:range netex:connectorStandard ;
    skos:editorialNote "NeTEx enumeration: PlugTypeEnumeration."@en ;
    skos:narrower netex:connectorStandard-undefined ,
        netex:connectorStandard-type1 ,
        netex:connectorStandard-type2 ,
        netex:connectorStandard-type3 ,
        netex:connectorStandard-typeE ,
        netex:connectorStandard-typeF ,
        netex:connectorStandard-typeG ,
        netex:connectorStandard-typeJ ,
        netex:connectorStandard-combinedChargingSystem ,
        netex:connectorStandard-ccsCombo1Plug ,
        netex:connectorStandard-ccsCombo2Plug ,
        netex:connectorStandard-tesla ,
        netex:connectorStandard-nema520 ,
        netex:connectorStandard-avcon ,
        netex:connectorStandard-CHAdeMO ,
        netex:connectorStandard-shockproof .

netex:location a skos:Concept ,
    owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    skos:inScheme netex:ev-charging ;
    skos:broader netex:ElectricVehicleChargingEquipment ;
    dcterms:type "Attribute" ;
    rdfs:domain netex:ElectricVehicleChargingEquipment ;
    skos:prefLabel "Location (Transmodel Point/Location)"@en ;
    skos:definition "The geographic location of the charging equipment, expressed via a Transmodel POINT / LOCATION (WGS84 latitude/longitude). In NeTEx the equipment is placed through an EQUIPMENT PLACE / SITE COMPONENT."@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Value type: structured (Transmodel POINT / LOCATION; WGS84 latitude/longitude)"@en .

netex:freeRecharging a skos:Concept ,
    owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    skos:inScheme netex:ev-charging ;
    skos:broader netex:ElectricVehicleChargingEquipment ;
    dcterms:type "Attribute" ;
    rdfs:domain netex:ElectricVehicleChargingEquipment ;
    skos:prefLabel "Free recharging"@en ;
    skos:definition "Whether the charging equipment can be used without a fee."@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Value type: xsd:boolean"@en ;
    skos:editorialNote "NeTEx element FreeRecharging (xsd:boolean)."@en ;
    rdfs:range xsd:boolean .

netex:reservationRequired a skos:Concept ,
    owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    skos:inScheme netex:ev-charging ;
    skos:broader netex:ElectricVehicleChargingEquipment ;
    dcterms:type "Attribute" ;
    rdfs:domain netex:ElectricVehicleChargingEquipment ;
    skos:prefLabel "Reservation required"@en ;
    skos:definition "Whether a reservation is required to use the charging equipment."@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Value type: xsd:boolean"@en ;
    skos:editorialNote "NeTEx element ReservationRequired (xsd:boolean)."@en ;
    rdfs:range xsd:boolean .

netex:reservationUrl a skos:Concept ,
    owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    skos:inScheme netex:ev-charging ;
    skos:broader netex:ElectricVehicleChargingEquipment ;
    dcterms:type "Attribute" ;
    rdfs:domain netex:ElectricVehicleChargingEquipment ;
    skos:prefLabel "Reservation URL"@en ;
    skos:definition "A URL at which the charging equipment can be reserved."@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Value type: xsd:anyURI"@en ;
    skos:editorialNote "NeTEx element ReservationUrl (xsd:anyURI)."@en ;
    rdfs:range xsd:anyURI .

netex:gridVoltage a skos:Concept ,
    owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    skos:inScheme netex:ev-charging ;
    skos:broader netex:ElectricVehicleChargingEquipment ;
    dcterms:type "Attribute" ;
    rdfs:domain netex:ElectricVehicleChargingEquipment ;
    skos:prefLabel "Grid voltage (V)"@en ;
    skos:definition "The grid supply voltage delivered to the charging equipment."@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Value type: xsd:decimal (V)"@en ;
    skos:editorialNote "NeTEx element GridVoltage, type VoltageType (xsd:decimal, SI volts)."@en ;
    rdfs:range xsd:decimal .

netex:currentType a skos:Concept ,
    owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    skos:inScheme netex:ev-charging ;
    skos:broader netex:ElectricVehicleChargingEquipment ;
    dcterms:type "Attribute" ;
    rdfs:domain netex:ElectricVehicleChargingEquipment ;
    skos:prefLabel "Current type"@en ;
    skos:definition "Classification of the supplied current as AC or DC. Renders the NeTEx CurrentType."@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Value type: enumeration (NeTEx CurrentTypeEnumeration)"@en ;
    rdfs:range netex:currentType ;
    skos:editorialNote "NeTEx enumeration: CurrentTypeEnumeration."@en ;
    skos:narrower netex:currentType-undefined ,
        netex:currentType-1PhaseAC ,
        netex:currentType-3PhaseAC ,
        netex:currentType-DC .

netex:powerCouplingType a skos:Concept ,
    owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    skos:inScheme netex:ev-charging ;
    skos:broader netex:ElectricVehicleChargingEquipment ;
    dcterms:type "Attribute" ;
    rdfs:domain netex:ElectricVehicleChargingEquipment ;
    skos:prefLabel "Power coupling type"@en ;
    skos:definition "Classification of how power is coupled to the vehicle (plug, pantograph, induction, etc.). Renders the NeTEx PowerCouplingType."@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Value type: enumeration (NeTEx PowerCouplingTypeEnumeration)"@en ;
    rdfs:range netex:powerCouplingType ;
    skos:editorialNote "NeTEx enumeration: PowerCouplingTypeEnumeration."@en ;
    skos:narrower netex:powerCouplingType-undefined ,
        netex:powerCouplingType-plug ,
        netex:powerCouplingType-pantographAbove ,
        netex:powerCouplingType-pantograph ,
        netex:powerCouplingType-induction ,
        netex:powerCouplingType-other .

netex:fuelType a skos:Concept ,
    owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    skos:inScheme netex:ev-charging ;
    skos:broader netex:RefuellingEquipment ;
    dcterms:type "Attribute" ;
    rdfs:domain netex:RefuellingEquipment ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fuel type"@en ;
    skos:definition "The type(s) of fuel or energy delivered by the refuelling equipment. Renders the NeTEx FuelType / FuelTypes."@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Value type: enumeration (NeTEx FuelTypeEnumeration)"@en ;
    rdfs:range netex:fuelType ;
    skos:editorialNote "NeTEx enumeration: FuelTypeEnumeration."@en ;
    skos:narrower netex:fuelType-battery ,
        netex:fuelType-biodiesel ,
        netex:fuelType-diesel ,
        netex:fuelType-dieselBatteryHybrid ,
        netex:fuelType-electricContact ,
        netex:fuelType-electricity ,
        netex:fuelType-ethanol ,
        netex:fuelType-hydrogen ,
