# === CROSS-LINKS (2026-08-18 full-scope expansion) ========================
# Additional skos:narrower triples from pre-existing Entities to the newly
# added Attributes above, plus the ConceptScheme's extended top-concept
# membership. Written as standalone subject-predicate-object statements
# rather than as edits to the original skos:narrower / skos:hasTopConcept
# comma-lists earlier in this file, so every original line stays byte-
# identical; these are purely new triples layered on top of the existing
# graph (RDF/Turtle allows a subject's statements to be split across several
# blocks — the triple set is what matters, not the surface grouping).
netex:ElectricVehicleChargingEquipment skos:narrower netex:typeOfPlug .

netex:RechargingEquipmentProfile skos:narrower netex:profileTypeOfPlug ,
    netex:compatibleWith .

netex:RechargingPointAssignment skos:narrower netex:siteComponent ,
    netex:equipmentPlace ,
    netex:vehicleChargingEquipment .

netex:ev-charging skos:hasTopConcept netex:TypeOfPlug ,
    netex:TypeOfBatteryChemistry ,
    netex:RechargingBay .

